- id: quantum-fiber---360-wifi-qf-tech-assist_flow4
  name: 360 Wifi Overview
  description: "360 WiFi creates a network throughout the home or business to ensure\
    \ devices receive the best connection possible. This makes spotty, inconsistent\
    \ connections, and voids without the Internet a problem of the past. It also includes\
    \ a primary control system that routes and directs traffic to connected and Smart\
    \ Home / Internet of Things (IoT) devices. Reducing slow-downs, parental controls,\
    \ and enhanced cyber security is available and activated. Axon\_Cyber Security"
  steps: []
- id: quantum-fiber---360-wifi-qf-tech-assist_flow5
  name: Ordering and Removing 360 WiFi
  description: The customer should use the website to order new service, add 360 WiFi
    to existing service, or to disconnect existing service, and to return equipment.
  steps: []
- id: quantum-fiber---360-wifi-qf-tech-assist_flow6
  name: SSID and Password/The Quantum Fiber App
  description: "Customers should utilize the QF App to establish a SSID and Password.\
    \ If the customer purchased their phone out of the country, for example, the customer\
    \ purchased an iPhone in Germany, they will have issues trying to download the\
    \ app. The customer should update their region details\_in the settings menu to\
    \ be able to view the US version of their store. See more information in the Tech\
    \ Assist Scenarios section of this document."
  steps: []
- id: quantum-fiber---360-wifi-qf-tech-assist_flow7
  name: Identifying a 360 WiFi7 Customer
  description: 'In Salesforce:'
  steps: []
