  name: SmartNID Activation Troubleshooting
  description: "If a SmartNID fails to activate, follow the steps in the Troubleshooting\
    \ SmartNID Activation section of the Quantum Fiber \u2013 SmartNID document. \
    \ The link for this can be found in the Related Links section of this document."
  steps: []
- id: quantum-fiber---360-wifi-qf-tech-assist_flow10
  name: Claiming and Activating SmartNIDs or Pods
  description: 'Note:  It has been discovered that when a SmartNID is swapped, the
    system does not automatically trigger a DHCP refresh for W1701K pods. After swapping
    an ONT/SmartNID all W1701K pods must be removed and then added back to the account.
    Refer to Removing Pods, Unclaiming Pods, and Adding Pods sections of the QMate
    document for process of unclaiming and adding Pods.'
