  description: To connect to WiFi, customers will either select 360 WiFi or bring
    their own WiFi solution (if the option is available in the buy-flow). If a customer
    declines 360 WiFi and indicates they want to provide their own equipment, a Third
    Party Equipment Requirements notice will appear to the customer.
