  name: Overview
  description: 'G.Fast (G-Series Fast Access to Subscriber) technology allows the
    company to improve broadband service for existing and underserved MDU/MTUs, where
    placing new fiber or Cat5e/6 to the unit is cost prohibitive.  G.Fast programming
    and capabilities will vary slightly based on the device type: CALIX E7 Casa G.Fast:'
  steps: []
