  description: "There are 2 instances of CALIX SMx \u2013 One for Lumen, and one for\
    \ Brightspeed, which is also where the Wisconsin T096 properties are. Lumen SMx:\
    \ https://155.70.106.84:3443/smx/ Brightspeed SMx: https://155.70.71.71:3443/smx/"
  steps: []
- id: calix-e3-16f-e5-16f-gfast-smx-programming-remote-tech-assist_flow6
  name: View Service
  description: Agent can view service by searching for the subscriber TN / DTN (Subscriber
    Search), or by navigating to the Device and viewing the port (Manual Port Search).
    A normal view for G.FAST would display both INTERFACE and SUBSCRIBERS.
